\title{mglpa: Multi-Group Latent Profile Analysis and Tests of Profile Similarity}
\description{
Estimates latent profile analysis (LPA) models with continuous indicators across known groups and implements the sequence of multi-group tests of profile similarity proposed by Morin, Meyer, Creusier and Bietry (2016) \doi{10.1177/1094428115621148}: class enumeration, configural, structural, dispersion, distributional, predictive and explanatory similarity. Estimation is carried out in R with an expectation-maximisation algorithm using random starts, with maximum-likelihood and robust (sandwich) standard errors, so that no external mixture-modelling software is required.
}
